        }
    },
    "3": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh dear,",
                "not the shrine maiden!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A moon rabbit!?",
                "Fine, I'll beat you up on the way."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Go ahead and try me!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Earth is so full of impurity."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But it's so pleasant here."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place isn't like that Lunar Capital.",
                "I so wanna live somewhere like this!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I feel like I could beat anyone right now!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even this rabbit lady here!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's fight!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's some quarrelsome youkai here too! Yes!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder, is that the influence of",
                "impurity after staying here for so long?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "'Cause that's maybe a little bit embarrassing."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Look, I did it!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, miss rabbit.",
                "I don't feel like losing to anyone now~"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hehehe, me too!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm also in a fighting mood!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By using this Lunar Jewel, I should be",
                "able to make a comfortable spot to live."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've got to be careful not to lose it."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, that's that forest magician over there!"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everyone says she's got a habit of stealing",
                "things. I have to be careful."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, isn't it the moon rabbit?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your face tells me that you've got something to hide."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't tell me you're holding onto some valuable",
                "moon item or something?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kuh, I'll beat you up before you do!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have to be always on guard here on Earth."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's scary if that's what",
                "impurity can do."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is this the Lunar Capital's scheme?",
                "It's unlikely, but..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, it's the magician of the forest."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everyone says she's got a habit of stealing",
                "things. Gotta be careful."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oi, stop doing that \"hiding something\" kinda face!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Say, aren't you that moon rabbit from a while ago?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kuh, I'll beat you up before you do!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a treasure hunter!"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I might have to skillfully change the topic,",
                "so she won't find out about the jewel."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My treasure-sensing rods are picking up a faint signal."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It looks like the treasure could be around here!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh... I think I know you."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're Tesso, right?",
                "I heard the rumors about you."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?",
                "No, I'm not."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?",
                "But I heard you live in the temple."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I live there, but you're mistaken.",
                "I'm not Tesso."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since you live in a temple,",
                "isn't it the same thing?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's with all this useless bickering?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...No, wait.",
                "My rods are still picking up that faint signal."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I see."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have the jewel, don't you?"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Jewel?",
                "I've got nothing, I swear!"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Enough bluffing!",
                "I'll just force the truth out of you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This rat doesn't know when to give up!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll have to use my ultimate technique!",
                "Lie with flattery!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm amazed by your sharp sense of smell!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I <i$did> have the jewel",
                "not too long ago."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I wanted to hide it from",
                "a treasure hunter like you."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So I just made a good trade with",
                "someone else who wanted it..."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?",
                "I really don't have it!?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uwah!? Did I really drop it mid-battle!?",
                "What am I gonna do..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I knew you were suspicious."
            ]
        }
    },
