        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......That's right."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have a jewel, right?"
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? A jewel?",
                "I don't have any!"
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I had enough! If I have to search you",
