            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I see, I see."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The moon rabbit is asking me to find a lost item."
            ]
        },
        "140_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I asked that treasure hunter mouse too,",
                "but I don't really trust her."
            ]
        },
        "148_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From what I heard, finding a lost item is a cakewalk",
                "for a tube-fox like you who's skilled at delicate work."
            ]
        },
        "156_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll take the job, but my help won't come cheap."
            ]
        },
        "164_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm sure I'll figure something out for the money!"
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Please do it for me.",
                "Misuse of that Lunar Jewel is a very serious matter."
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also, I have one more condition."
            ]
        },
        "188_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't handle tasks from weaklings."
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because the weaklings always spill the beans",
                "with a little interrogation."
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I hope you aren't one of those."
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that enough for you?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Take my job request already!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If that Lunar Jewel were misused..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, hey, who do you think I am?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your job is already done."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I dispatched one of my associates mid-battle.",
                "They've already found something like your item."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seriously?",
                "Where, where?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems a beast youkai in the ",
                "Forest of Magic is holding onto it."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's already gone."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was about to tell her the other candidate. Nevermind."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Being a weakling is bad you know."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Forest of Magic is so big!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wouldn't it be nice if I found it right now?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, a rabbit."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're not my target, looks like.",
                "It's dangerous 'round here, so go home."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, that pendant!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hn?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's my jewel!?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's mine."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's an important jewel I got from the matriarch."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kuh, can't get it back without a fight it seems!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is your problem?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just wanna take a look at your pendant."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think it was mine..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can have a look."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But even if it's yours, I won't hand it over!"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Guh...",
                "J-Just show it to me already!"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm <i$not> giving it, you know that?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I know, I know."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It..."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It isn't mine!? But it looks the same!"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then...?",
                "What happened to my jewel...?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is your problem?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......Ow ow ow—",
                "My head hurts!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What happened?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've never seen you before."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm Saki Kurokoma, matriarch of the Keiga Family.",
                "Who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seiran.",
                "I'm a moon rabbit so scary that I can silence a crying child."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A moon rabbit!?",
                "But you're the one crying here. What gives?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't help it. This place..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place has some scent that I never felt before. It's agonizing."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aah, I see now.",
                "You moon rabbits aren't used to it."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is the scent of death.",
                "It'll feel good when you get used to it."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Scent of death!?",
                "What on Earth is this place..."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You still don't know after you've seen it?",
                "How innocent."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is Hell,",
                "where the exceptionally wicked fall."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell!?"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, what did you do?"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a harsh sentence!",
                "I only lost a jewel!"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lost a jewel...",
                "A-hah-hah-hah!"
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no way you could fall to Hell",
                "with such a minor evil!"
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "B-but—"
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you insist, I'll",
                "help you out."
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You moon rabbits are rare beyond comparison."
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It'd be a waste to leave you be possessed",
                "by boring vengeful spirits in such Hell."
            ]
        },
        "296_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll help me?",
                "Yay!"
            ]
        },
        "304_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But, you'll have to face me",
                "in a fierce and decisive battle."
            ]
        },
        "312_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no value in helping you",
                "if you're weak beyond saving,"
            ]
        },
        "320_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That kind of person again."
            ]
        },
        "328_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's alright.",
                "I'm already used to the deathly scent!"
            ]
        },
        "336_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's like that crying rabbit isn't here anymore."
            ]
        },
        "344_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's promising, show me all you've got!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A shame. You've got nothing worth helping."
            ]
        }
    }
